{
  "slug": "coderocket",
  "name": "Coderocket",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generate production-ready CI/CD workflows from any codebase. CodeRocket analyzes your repo, builds a GitHub Actions pipeline, and opens a PR — zero to deployed in 60 seconds. Supports 8 languages, 15+ frameworks, and every major cloud platform.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **3 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `cicd-generation` (Generate production-ready CI/CD pipelines for a repository with CodeRocket)\n- **Commands** (3): `deploy` (Generate a CI/CD workflow for this project and open a pull request), `review` (View AI code reviews and findings for your pull requests), `status` (Check CodeRocket account status, API health, usage, and connected repos)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `coderocket`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install coderocket@claude-community` from `mlgraham/coderocket-plugin`.",
